    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry based in Antwerp, Belgium (registered as Type Tailors BV), founded 2018 by Fred Smeijers and Corina Cotorobai after leaving OurType. Parent company Type Tailors (est. 2008) does bespoke, proprietary typeface commissions for clients including Philips, TomTom, Bentley and Porsche. TYPE BY itself publishes 140+ retail typefaces (1,400+ styles) including Arnhem, Quadraat, Sansa and Fakt. Design roster: Fred Smeijers (senior, internationally known Dutch type designer, author of Counterpunch, professor at Leipzig/KABK), Thomas Thiemich (Head of Font Development), Hendrik Weber, Merel Wagner, Maurice Goldner, Pierre Pane-Farre, several also teaching type design at university level. Small, senior, highly specialised foundry team rather than a broad agency. No LinkedIn company page found after a couple of searches. Instagram context shot (typeby_com) could not be captured logged-out (errored twice under likely rate-limiting); queued to state/ig-queue.json for a logged-in ig.py pass.",
